msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/RAIN/RAIN_KAB0109.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0109.BIN::line:287_0_5"
msgid "No.{PA:20} So you kids had your secret fort taken||over by some bullies,{PA:10} huh?{PA:20}"
